# The bench session's clean finish in the simulator: the re-verify run with
# stage 6's row failing (bench_sim set fail_s6, a must-pass step).  The
# video steps that need it skip by themselves (one "Skipping ahead"
# screen), the groups that don't still run (the second core, its restart
# and soak), and the session ends: no verified line, no clock150 token,
# each step once and in order.  The soak fails too (bench_sim set
# fail_ucop2: a stall), so ucop's "cop" switch is taken away: the unit's
# next start runs the build default (the daily driver after the sitting).
# Generated by scripts/bench_sim_script.py (s6fail); edit that, not this.
# needs: video
# golden: skip
# log: ui switch cleared
# log: fault switch: ucop2 sees a stall
# nolog: next start: ui cop
# nolog: bench_sim: watchdog
# timeout: 300
wait 4000
bench_sim reset          # no results files, the model's defaults
bench_sim set fail_s6    # stage 6's row fails (a must-pass step)
wheel +20 40            # the last row (Now Playing while music plays)
wait 400
wheel -1 200            # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
key SELECT              # About
wait 1500
chord SELECT+LEFT 3200  # Developer
wait 1000
wheel +1 200            # Bench session
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +40 10          # Re-verify the video image
wait 400
wheel -1 200
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # the confirm screen: start
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
